                        "entry_id": "063126fe-7b7d-34bb-9a60-3c89b2d1ecdf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "In a testy way; in the manner of someone who is testy."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f9a3a967-62d0-46f7-9639-4c3c04bbfda7",
                                "sense_id": "c513c8a0-5e1a-3ffb-9668-465f6cf96156",
                                "text": "[…]thinking it urgent to say something, I asked him presently if he felt any cold draught from the door, which was behind him.\n\"No, no!\" he responded shortly and somewhat testily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd170735-29c3-41ca-99e0-8afa86c0eea8",
                                "sense_id": "c513c8a0-5e1a-3ffb-9668-465f6cf96156",
                                "text": "`We have been looking for a mystery, and we certainly seem to have found one.' `What do I make of it? Why, that your poor dear father was off his head, of course,' I answered, testily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10fd8ff3-eceb-47b7-b5e6-e486cd78c7f7",
                                "sense_id": "c513c8a0-5e1a-3ffb-9668-465f6cf96156",
                                "text": "\"Sit ye down, I'm sayin',\" said Uncle Jobson testily."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a99e2ffc-84a6-4210-bab0-7893354e064b",
                                "sense_id": "c513c8a0-5e1a-3ffb-9668-465f6cf96156",
                                "text": "“Starve? Stuff and nonsense!” he retorted testily. “No able-bodied fellow need starve nowadays. [...] Pshaw! Starve! That's always your, cuckoo cry!”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca0d47ed-6585-45be-9dbe-d15d566b6ff1",
                                "sense_id": "c513c8a0-5e1a-3ffb-9668-465f6cf96156",
                                "text": "'Oh, for heaven's sake,' said Prak and died testily."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
